<http://data.silknow.org/object/bf31ac15-e594-349c-b039-3039f776b7f3>
        a                   ecrm:E73_Information_Object ;
        rdfs:comment        "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden, 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts', <i>Hali</i> 59 (October 1991) pp. 102-111.  Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal, usually in pale shades."@en ;
        ecrm:P129_is_about  <http://data.silknow.org/object/179c592a-2834-3c88-bdd3-0ca6d4fed834> ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/information/bibliography> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This embroidery belongs to Group 3 as defined by Jennifer Wearden, 'Azerbaijanian Embroideries: A Synthesis of Contrasts', <i>Hali</i> 59 (October 1991) pp. 102-111.  Group 3 textiles are characterised by  surface darning on the diagonal, usually in pale shades."@en .
